      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَظْنَنْتُهُ الشَّىْءَ</span></b>  <i>I made him to think the thing.</i>
(M, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَظْنَنْتُ بِهِ النَّاسَ</span> [<i>I made the
people to suspect him:</i> or] <i>I exposed him to suspicion;</i> (M, Msb, TA;) [and] so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَظنَنْتُهُ</span> [alone].
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also 1, last quarter.

